{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 1. Overall Experience\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Hi, I\u8217'm Anish Bandal. I explored the website and found it quite helpful for researching different tractor models.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 2. Issues and Suggestions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 One problem I noticed is that users need clear price information to decide whether a tractor fits their budget. Showing the estimated price and monthly EMI directly on tractor cards would help users shortlist models more quickly.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 3. Positive Aspects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 What I liked about the website is that it provides useful tractor specifications in one place. I also liked the comparison feature because it makes it easier to evaluate different options without switching between multiple pages.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 4. Overall Feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Overall, the website offers a good starting point for tractor buyers. Making price information more visible would make the experience even better.\par}
